        "title": "洁净与健康",
        "description": "「健康之家」的戈尔珊小姐正在为医院内的卫生状况发愁…",
        "rewards": [],
        "rewards_formatted": "",
        "chapter": {
            "icon": "",
            "id": "",
            "num": "",
            "title": ""
        },
        "total_dialogue_lines": 47,
